== Evidence and controls

Plan commit `8a7434f59f3795d2f803ddaafc665e917aaf44c0` was published before dispatch. Hosted run *42446577502*, formal job *128626693105*, and artifact *13603993525* bind the named declaration `CryptoResearch.Semaev.decidable_validDecomposition`; artifact ZIP SHA-256 is `181433aeee8e030b0d33787e4d72e95d69ca9e59212abd6de864a48257cf3897`. The audit reports 1,313 theorems with standard axioms only. J1 checked empty tuple/span, off-curve input and wrong target. J3's wrong-name and changed-hash controls failed as expected; a self-consistent synthetic receipt passed the consistency checker, so external run custody matters.

== Independence and next construction

Three reviewers sealed separate reports. Their first J1/J2 YAML attestations had format defects; original bytes and seals are retained, and reviewer-issued additive metadata corrections leave the reports and verdicts unchanged. The final independence checker passes *3/3* owned joints. Next, freeze the wire-to-Lean record contract, bind one immutable sample to field, curve, span, tuple and target, then execute the instantiated decision with authenticated evidence. The raw-coordinate lemma needs a separate named audit.

